  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Transport seams (II2cBus, ISpiBus, ISerialTransport, IPwmChannel, IDShotTransport) with System.Device adapters for hardware-free unit tests\n      - BMI160 IMU over SPI (SPI-mode activation and read-bit protocol)\n      - UBX NAV-PVT GPS parsing with Fletcher-8 validation and NED-to-local velocity mapping\n      - DShot frame/CRC codec and DShotMotorDevice over an IDShotTransport seam\n      - BMI160, NMEA, and PWM drivers refactored onto transports with full test coverage",
